          "kind": "MCQ",
          "points": 0.2,
          "prompt": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Suppose we are considering a binary search tree.<br/>Select the most correct java code snippet that search a node with value x.</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\">A.  Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> root;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(p.info != x &amp;&amp; p!=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n  { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info) p = p.left;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> p=p.right;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n}\n\nB.  Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> root;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(p.info != x)\n  { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info) p = p.left;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> p=p.right;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n}\n\nC.  Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> root;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(p!=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> &amp;&amp; p.info != x)\n  { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info) p = p.left;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> p=p.right;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n}</code></pre></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Giả sử ta đang xét một cây tìm kiếm nhị phân (BST).<br/>Chọn đoạn mã Java đúng nhất để tìm một node có giá trị x.</p><pre><code class=\"language-java\">A.  Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> root;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(p.info != x &amp;&amp; p!=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span>)\n  { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info) p = p.left;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> p=p.right;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n}\n\nB.  Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> root;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(p.info != x)\n  { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info) p = p.left;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> p=p.right;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n}\n\nC.  Node <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">search</span><span class=\"hljs-params\">(<span class=\"hljs-type\">int</span> x)</span>\n{ <span class=\"hljs-type\">Node</span> <span class=\"hljs-variable\">p</span> <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> root;\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">while</span>(p!=<span class=\"hljs-literal\">null</span> &amp;&amp; p.info != x)\n  { <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span>(x&lt;p.info) p = p.left;\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">else</span> p=p.right;\n  }\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">return</span>(p);\n}</code></pre></div>",
